        "userMessage": "Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"19110\", \"reply_to_id\": \"19109\", \"sender_id\": \"8518484672\", \"sender\": \"Jonathan\", \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-15 03:37 PDT\", \"has_reply_context\": true } ``` Sender (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"label\": \"Jonathan (8518484672)\", \"id\": \"8518484672\", \"name\": \"Jonathan\" } ``` Replied message (untrusted, for context): ```json { \"sender_label\": \"pelican\", \"body\": \"I wrote the full file-backed plan and committed it.\\n\\n• Artifact: task-artifacts/PEL-092/execution-master-plan-2026-04-15.md\\n• Commit: 39aefc8 (pelican: write execution master plan reset)\\n\\nBlunt shape of the plan:\\n\\n0. Fix the lie first\\n\\nMake config, selector, decision files, ledger, and dashboards agree on what is actually live.\\nRight now config says 4 structures, live upstream still behaves like 2.\\n\\n1. Unblock true four-vertical live generation\\n\\nThis is the current structural blocker.\\nReplace the credit-only live entrypoint, remove the hardcoded two-structure selector subset, and prove fresh dry decision files emit:\\n\\n• bull_call\\n• bear_call\\n• bear_put\\n• bull_put\\n\\n2. Finish debit entry/ranking truth\\n\\nMake debit spreads economically correct end to end:\\n\\n• fair value\\n• executable debit price\\n• signed edge math\\n• max-loss semantics\\n• logging/ledger fields\\n\\n3. Fix small-beans sizing deliberately\\n\\nSeparate:\\n\\n• correctness fixes from\\n• risk appetite changes\\n\\nCurrent truth is not “caps crushed us.”\\nYesterday’s fills were small because the tier map is conservative:\\n\\n• tier1: >= 2.5% → 1 unit\\n• tier2: >= 8.0% → 2 units\\n• tier3: off\\n\\nSo the plan calls for replay-backed sizing study first, then a concrete recommendation.\\n\\n4. Finish portfolio-aware execution\\n\\nImplement the approved doctrine:\\n\\n• one live slot per {ticker, structure}\\n• max four verticals per ticker\\n• covariance/overlap penalties\\n• incumbents compete with new candidates\\n• close-and-replace only if net switch value is positive after real costs\\n\\n5. Finish exit/lifecycle parity\\n\\nMake repriced-edge primary for all four structures, not just the legacy credit pair.\\n\\n6. Catch operator surfaces up\\n\\nDashboards/logs/reporting need to show:\\n\\n• all four structures\\n• debit vs credit\\n• emitted vs selected vs submitted vs filled\\n• spread units vs raw broker order quantity\\n• reject reasons and structure mix\\n\\n7. Replay and acceptance proof\\n\\nRun replay/shadow proof over the recent window and compare:\\n\\n• old two-structu…[truncated]\" } ``` Do this entire plan end to end now deploy it!",
